openmediavault-nvmetcp (8.0.1) experimental; urgency=low

  * Remove the namespace read-only option; it was never supported by the
    kernel nvmet target
  * Fix subsystem and association changes not marking the config dirty
  * Fix port address selection and IPv6 listeners
  * Auto-assign missing namespace NSIDs
  * Use the configured subsystem serial and model
  * Re-enable setSubsystem parameter validation
  * Fix NQN generation, uniqueness checks on edit, and list display
  * Fix subsystems with a single host or namespace being returned as an
    object instead of a list

 -- OpenMediaVault Plugin Developers <plugins@omv-extras.org>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0500

